{"title":"2006 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 14","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> be the roots of the equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/7/f2787cc2c741509cc364d73b58f86c788da59c21.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2-mx+2=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"130\" height=\"16\" />. Suppose that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/0/e505372ca41c86f6672a6801b75efd23db2a3098.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+\\frac1b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"43\" height=\"37\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/9/5/295ea0f852c92e630bf5e2af8d760929420f6954.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b+\\frac1a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"42\" height=\"37\" /> are the roots of the equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/c/3/ac36e406af02bf6555ee54ff421e92be152afb9f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2-px+q=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"126\" height=\"20\" />. What is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/1/0615acc3725de21025457e7d6f7694dab8e2f758.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/4/1/641446adf4ff407ab449e0d92666584f79d980cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) } \\frac{5}{2}\\qquad \\textbf{(B) } \\frac{7}{2}\\qquad \\textbf{(C) } 4\\qquad \\textbf{(D) } \\frac{9}{2}\\qquad \\textbf{(E) } 8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"367\" height=\"38\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/3dfbWzOfJAI?t=457\">https://youtu.be/3dfbWzOfJAI?t=457</a>\n</p><p>~ pi_is_3.14596253589793238462643383279502884197169399375105820974944592307816406286208998628034825342117067\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In a <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Quadratic_equation\" title=\"Quadratic equation\">quadratic equation</a> of the form <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/8/2/48240238b0a7255fd48482f895e8cb2149ca9b8d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2 + bx + c = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"121\" height=\"16\" />, the product of the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Root\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Root\">roots</a> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> (<a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Vieta%27s_Formulas\" title=\"Vieta&#39;s Formulas\">Vieta's Formulas</a>).\n</p><p>Using this property, we have that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/8/f/18fbcfabf473b776f1b72c23aab537ae5993b60f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ab=2$\" width=\"50\" height=\"12\" /> and\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/2/f12377ddf1a26499dd19910d8dd73deff546a8c3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$q = (a+\\frac{1}{b})\\cdot(b+\\frac{1}{a}) = \\frac{ab+1}{b} \\cdot \\frac{ab+1}{a}  = \\frac{(ab+1)^2}{ab} = \\frac{(2+1)^2}{2} = \\boxed{\\textbf{(D) }\\frac{9}{2}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"581\" height=\"49\" />.\n</p>\n<ul><li>Notice the fact that we never actually found the roots.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Assume <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Without_loss_of_generality\" title=\"Without loss of generality\">without loss of generality</a> that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/4/904f27995d33e0d39f43ec959e7cb100516e9396.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m=3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"51\" height=\"14\" />. We can factor the equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/d/5/8d51dced775e273dc9699181601dd8b18b78545c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2-3x+2=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"123\" height=\"16\" /> into <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/3/903719e118778a59337eda2f412e50160c6acd81.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x-1)(x-2)=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"144\" height=\"18\" />. Therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/0/2/502e059d1a020b368aee3a99c5669d88331d321f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"45\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/d/6/7d65baaf9671227780dd04ab952911036aa5c868.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b=2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"43\" height=\"14\" />. Using these values, we find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/e/0/de0c244682a2c9137d52533c86a9b89bfe8805ce.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+\\frac1b=\\frac32$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"80\" height=\"37\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/8/8c833d8ca6b692e229bc900677c1a8bf57910efa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b+\\frac1a=3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"76\" height=\"37\" />. By <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Vieta%27s_formulas\" title=\"Vieta&#39;s formulas\">Vieta's formulas</a>, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/1/0615acc3725de21025457e7d6f7694dab8e2f758.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> is the product of the roots of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/c/3/ac36e406af02bf6555ee54ff421e92be152afb9f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2-px+q=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"126\" height=\"20\" />, which are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/0/e505372ca41c86f6672a6801b75efd23db2a3098.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+\\frac1b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"43\" height=\"37\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/9/5/295ea0f852c92e630bf5e2af8d760929420f6954.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b+\\frac1a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"42\" height=\"37\" />. Therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/a/d1ac9be832a49c5519646ae0009983b9e6014024.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$q=\\left(a+\\frac1b\\right)\\left(b+\\frac1a\\right)=\\frac32\\cdot3=\\boxed{\\textbf{(D) }\\frac92}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"323\" height=\"49\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_10B\" title=\"2006 AMC 10B\">2006 AMC 10B</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_10B_Problems\" title=\"2006 AMC 10B Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_10B_Answer_Key\" title=\"2006 AMC 10B Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2006 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 13\">Problem 13</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2006 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 15\">Problem 15</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2006 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2006 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2006 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2006 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2006 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2006 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2006 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2006 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2006 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2006 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2006 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2006 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2006 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2006 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"2006 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"2006 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"2006 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"2006 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"2006 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"2006 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"2006 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"2006 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"2006 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"2006 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 25\">25</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AMC_10_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AMC 10 Problems and Solutions\"> All AMC 10 Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Vieta%27s_formulas\" title=\"Vieta&#39;s formulas\">Vieta's formulas</a></li></ul>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-descri